 "meta": {
  "id": "b8c051e8d91826ceb552fe1af7d68ad4",
  "name": {
   "zh": "3D 跟踪点 · TAPIP3D",
   "en": "3D Tracks · TAPIP3D"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "TAPIP3D 做单目 RGB 和 RGB-D 画面的长时前馈三维点跟踪：把画面特征抬进持久的世界坐标特征云，抵掉摄影机自身的运动，跨帧轨迹估计更准。这张卡由 ViPE 给出摄影机和深度贴图，交付 3D 跟踪点 USD（里面同时带 ViPE 的摄影机）。TAPIP3D 本身可商用，整张卡标非商用是因为 ViPE 的深度。",
   "en": "TAPIP3D does long-term feed-forward 3D point tracking for monocular RGB and RGB-D footage: it lifts image features into a persistent world-space feature cloud that cancels the camera's own motion, giving more accurate tracks across frames. On this card ViPE provides the camera and depth maps, and it delivers a 3D tracks USD (which also holds the ViPE camera). TAPIP3D itself allows commercial use; the whole card is marked non-commercial because of ViPE's depth."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-13T12:00:00",
  "deliverable": "tracks3d",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
